tray
====

tray is a frontend for the Anbernic RG35XXSP that runs PlayStation, Game Boy
Advance, Game Boy and Game Boy Color games on top of BaseOS.

It is built on slot by Brandon Kowalski (https://github.com/BrandonKowalski/slot),
whose git history it carries. slot is licensed under the GNU General Public
License v3.0, and so is tray; see LICENSE. The licenses of the fonts, shaders,
bezel art and emulator cores tray ships are in licenses/.

PlayStation emulation is by PCSX ReARMed (https://github.com/libretro/pcsx_rearmed),
licensed under the GNU General Public License v2.0 or later, built from the
commit pinned in cores/pcsx/build.sh.
